        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Glynn Johnson 410 Series Medium-Duty Concealed Overhead Holder / Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>The Glynn Johnson  410 series </b>Improved design allows for simple field changing of functions to compensate for changes in user requirements. \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Hold Open </b><br>\r\nHold-Open model feature a rugged, automatic hold-open. The hold-open mechanism has been cycled in excess of the 250,000 cycles required for a Grade-1 holder, providing an automatic, adjustable hold open when the door reaches the template degree of hold open.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Friction Hold-Open</b><br>\r\nFriction hold-open models provide an convenient multi-port hold-open mechanism, permitting the door to be held open at various degrees. The tension on the friction mechanism is adjustable. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Stop Only</b><br>\r\nThe stop-only models offer a smooth and rugged shock absorbing mechanism designed to protect door and frame. <br><br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/gly-410-series-2.jpg?v=1704354521\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Concealed</b> track mounts to a metal doors top rail or mortised into top of wood doors.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Glynn Johnson 410 Series Medium-Duty Concealed Overhead Holder/Stop",
                "description": "The Glynn Johnson  410 series Improved design allows for simple field changing of functions to compensate for changes in user requirements.  Available as Stop only or with Hold-Open in a wide color selection.",
